     "en": "A short story"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "Asha saw a seal with an animal carved on it in a museum.\n\"They used seals in trade,\" said her teacher."
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "explain",
    "type": "explanation",
    "provenance": "original",
